WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.728
Maya: Can you take Dad to his appointment tomorrow?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.860
Alex: Tomorrow? I thought you had it.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.843
Caring for someone means keeping track of a thousand little things.

00:00:14.099 --> 00:00:19.372
Meet Carestead. One shared care plan for tasks, appointments, and who's doing what.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:26.319
It spots coordination gaps, suggests the next step, and keeps you in control.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.592
Alex: I've got the ride. Can you handle the pickup?

00:00:31.199 --> 00:00:32.760
Maya: Yes. It's in the plan.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.199
Less to carry. More care to give.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.338
Carestead. Make room for what matters.
